{"kind":"symbol","hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/GnustoDangerousDark\/documentation\/GnustoDangerousDark"]]},"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/GnustoDangerousDark\/documentation\/GnustoDangerousDark\/DangerousDark","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"sections":[],"abstract":[{"text":"Darkness that kills: a warning on the first consecutive turn the player","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"ends in the dark, a configurable grace period, then death. Add it to a","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"game’s ","type":"text"},{"code":"content","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" block; there is nothing else to wire:","type":"text"}],"relationshipsSections":[{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/Gnusto\/documentation\/Gnusto\/GameContent","doc:\/\/GnustoDangerousDark\/s8SendableP","doc:\/\/GnustoDangerousDark\/s16SendableMetatypeP"],"kind":"relationships","title":"Conforms To","type":"conformsTo"}],"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"tokens":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"DangerousDark"}],"platforms":["macOS"],"languages":["swift"]}]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"text":"Overview","level":2,"anchor":"overview","type":"heading"},{"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing","code":["let dark = DangerousDark()          \/\/ stock prose, one turn of grace","","var content: GameContents {","    dark","}"]},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The daemon counts consecutive turns "},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"text":"ending","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":" in darkness, wherever"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"they’re spent, and a move counts the same as a wait. The warning turn is a"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"guarantee (the classic fairness contract), and a lightless dash toward"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"daylight is safe if no more than "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"graceTurns + 1"},{"text":" of its turns end in the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"dark. Any reachable light resets the count.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Death is a "},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"text":"dice roll","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":" once the grace runs out: the first dark turn only"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"warns, a configurable grace of guaranteed-safe turns follows, and then every"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"further dark turn rolls "},{"code":"chance(lethality)","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" to be eaten. The warning turn"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"itself is safe. This is not Zork’s rule. Zork’s grue keeps no count and can"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"kill only a player who tries to move out of a dark room, never one who"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"stands still; "},{"code":"FIDELITY.md","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" records the difference for both Zork games."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"UNDO after a death does not bring the warning back. The count is a"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"@Global"},{"type":"text","text":", so UNDO returns it to its value before the fatal turn, and a"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"next turn that also ends in the dark is a dice turn again. UNDO rewinds the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"seeded random stream too, so typing the fatal turn’s command again rolls"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the same death. A turn that ends in the light resets the count."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"To make the dark harmless for a stretch — a room whose solution is to stand"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"in it on purpose, a scene that should not be interrupted — set"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/GnustoDangerousDark\/documentation\/GnustoDangerousDark\/DangerousDark\/suspended","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":". "},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Do not stop the daemon by name."}]},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"stopDaemon(\"grue\")"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"freezes the counter at whatever it had reached, so resuming can land the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"player straight on a dice turn and cost them the warning; suspending resets"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the count for exactly that reason."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The daemon is named ","type":"text"},{"code":"\"grue\"","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":". Timer names are global, but two instances","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"of ","type":"text"},{"code":"DangerousDark","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" in one game already collide on their shared ","type":"text"},{"code":"@Global","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"namespace before the timer name matters — one lethal dark per game.","type":"text"}]}]}],"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/gnustodangerousdark\/dangerousdark"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"topicSections":[{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/GnustoDangerousDark\/documentation\/GnustoDangerousDark\/DangerousDark\/Text"],"generated":true,"title":"Structures","anchor":"Structures"},{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/GnustoDangerousDark\/documentation\/GnustoDangerousDark\/DangerousDark\/init(graceTurns:lethality:text:)"],"generated":true,"title":"Initializers","anchor":"Initializers"},{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/GnustoDangerousDark\/documentation\/GnustoDangerousDark\/DangerousDark\/suspended","doc:\/\/GnustoDangerousDark\/documentation\/GnustoDangerousDark\/DangerousDark\/timers"],"generated":true,"title":"Instance Properties","anchor":"Instance-Properties"},{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/GnustoDangerousDark\/documentation\/GnustoDangerousDark\/DangerousDark\/GameContent-Implementations"],"generated":true,"title":"Default Implementations","anchor":"Default-Implementations"}],"metadata":{"modules":[{"name":"GnustoDangerousDark"}],"fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"DangerousDark"}],"title":"DangerousDark","roleHeading":"Structure","role":"symbol","symbolKind":"struct","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"DangerousDark","kind":"identifier"}],"externalID":"s:19GnustoDangerousDark0bC0V"},"schemaVersion":{"major":0,"minor":3,"patch":0},"seeAlsoSections":[{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/GnustoDangerousDark\/documentation\/GnustoDangerousDark\/DangerousDark\/init(graceTurns:lethality:text:)","doc:\/\/GnustoDangerousDark\/documentation\/GnustoDangerousDark\/DangerousDark\/Text"],"generated":true,"title":"The content bundle","anchor":"The-content-bundle"}],"references":{"doc://GnustoDangerousDark/documentation/GnustoDangerousDark/DangerousDark/suspended":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/GnustoDangerousDark\/documentation\/GnustoDangerousDark\/DangerousDark\/suspended","kind":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"var","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"suspended","kind":"identifier"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Bool","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:Sb"}],"title":"suspended","type":"topic","abstract":[{"text":"Set while the dark is harmless: the grue idles, draws no randomness,","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"and — because the count resets on every suspended turn — resuming","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"always begins again at the warning.","type":"text"}],"role":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/gnustodangerousdark\/dangerousdark\/suspended"},"doc://GnustoDangerousDark/s8SendableP":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/GnustoDangerousDark\/s8SendableP","title":"Swift.Sendable","type":"unresolvable"},"doc://